{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/266413-angel-jacking","id":266413,"title":"Angel-Jacking","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Demon: The Descent"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-09-26T14:13:17-07:00","id":266413,"title":"Angel-Jacking","content":"So there's a couple things I'm a little confused about. You've got to use Angel-Jacking in the place where the Angel is coming into being, right? And the Angel coming into being is the result of an Occult Matrix. So is the actual location of where the Angel comes into being a result of that occult matrix? And if so, how does one actually begin the process of Angel-Jacking? Is it going to the site of the impending summoning and wishin' real hard?<br /> <br /> Anyone had an angel-jacking occur in a game so far?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I am no longer participating in the community. Please do not contact me about my previous work.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/159-leetsepeak","name":"Leetsepeak","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4259"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-26T18:33:09-07:00","id":266547,"title":"","content":"I'm not sure if it's correct, but going off the God-Machine rules update and it's rules on Angels there... I see the place where an Angel gets summoned to is an Infrastructure (The place needs the 'Infrastructure' Condition at least. Now whether this was an Infrastructure that created the Occult Matrix for the Angel summoning or the Occult Matrix made the place into an Infrastructure and the Angel was summoned because of that... I'd rather not say ^__^'<br /> As for the Angel-Jacking itself... Well, Primum is an element of it and it gets easier to do the higher it is. I wouldn't risk a newly Fallen Demon to do such a thing, maybe at Primum 3+ I may feel handy to give it a shot... The Core discusses how other Demons in the Cell can help out, which explicitly mentions that they would move round smashing and rerouting things to either boost the Demon's connection strength or jam the Angel's transmission. But to start the Angel-Jack, it seems fluff-wise the Demon needs to get to the Infrastructure where the Angel is due to be summoned and use their Primum to wirelessly connect to the incoming transmission the God-Machine has put in place.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3951-wander","name":"wander","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"409"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-29T02:44:14-07:00","id":268119,"title":"","content":"All infrastructure has components, remember. It has the infrastructure; the physical stuff. The occult matrix; the process of moving that stuff. And the output; the result of that stuff. Then the Linchpin; the stuff that screws all the other stuff up if it is messed with.<br /> <br /> An angel summoning is the output of infrastructure. In order to hijack it you need to get involved in the process of summoning the angel. Once you're interfacing with the infrastructure, and fighting any guardians it might have, you then need to wait and allow the infrastructure to continue the process of the occult matrix. Then, when the output is just about to come out, you make the contested action and, if you succeed, you've jacked the angel's cover.<br /> <br /> The practicality of this would vary on the infrastructure. You might interface with the infrastructure by combing a horse's hair, accessing a locked room, or logging onto a special computer. It may even be as simple as joining in on the prayers and chanting of the God-Machine cult that is summoning the angel.<br /> <br /> That, at least, was my understanding of how it worked?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3036-desolatedolly","name":"DesolateDolly","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3036_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"179"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-29T11:24:09-07:00","id":268372,"title":"","content":"I can get behind that... Long as it explains the Demon somehow using their Primum to effectively redirect the signal the God-Machine is directing into reality (which could in physical reality be done really with any of those examples given) to gain it themselves, all Infrastructure is different so the Angel-Jacking fluff-wise could be done through any action really. YMMV of course.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3951-wander","name":"wander","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"409"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}